    "title": "Crews respond to fire at gas station in Bryant - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ryan Turbeville ,\n6 hours ago\nBRYANT, Ark. – Fire crews responded to an apparent fire at a gas station in Bryant, as a pillar of smoke could be seen rising from the area.\nAs of 7:30 p.m. on Wednesday, the smoke coming from the fire at the Murphy USA on Bryant Avenue had stopped, but crews remained on the scene.\nThere is no word yet on a possible cause for the fire.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KLRT - FOX16.com.",
